     "body": "<p>fedora-modify-control-group scripts in server/bin, takes parameters</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>protocol</li>\n\t<li>user</li>\n\t<li>password</li>\n\t<li>pid:  single pid, comma-separated list, or <a href=\"file:///path/to/file\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">file:///path/to/file</a> specifying list of pids</li>\n\t<li>dsID: single datastream identifier or comma-separated list of datastream identifiers</li>\n\t<li>controlGroup: desired control group (only M is accepted)<br/>\nAdditional parameters:</li>\n\t<li>addXMLHeader - add an XML declaration including the UTF-8 character set</li>\n\t<li>reformat - reformat the XML (indenting)</li>\n\t<li>setMIMETypeCharset - add charset=UTF-8 to the MIMEType (this will be returned in http headers when getting the datastream content)</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>Web service call<br/>\n/management/control?action=modifyDatastreamControlGroup<br/>\nwith additional query parameters as above, excluding protocol, user and password</p>\n",
