  "description": "<p>Specifically to address \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-492\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-492\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Allow DC, RELS-EXT, etc, to be Managed Content\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-492\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n - allo DC, RELS-EXT etc to be managed content.</p>\n\n<p>The tool needs to migrate existing \"X\" datastreams to \"M\" to address this (we may consider making its scope more general)</p>\n\n<p>The tool needs to migrate all datastream versions, and should record the change in the audit trail.</p>",
